# =============================================================================
#  HARLEY QUINN - MAIN MENU IDLE LOOP  ("Mischief")       Roblox R15 / MrXen0 rig
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  HOW TO USE
#    1. Open your MrXen0_R15RIG .blend in Blender (5.0+ recommended).
#    2. Scripting workspace -> Text Editor -> New -> paste this whole file.
#    3. Press  Run Script  (Alt+P).  Done - the armature now has the action
#       "HarleyQuinn_Idle" assigned and the timeline set to 60 fps, frames 0-300.
#
#  WHAT IT DOES
#    * deletes any old "HarleyQuinn_Idle" action first (no lingering keyframes)
#    * sets the rig to FK mode (ARM_IK_FK / LEG_IK_FK = 0)
#    * keys ONLY the animated FK controls (full-body loop, so legs/pelvis are keyed)
#    * all curves BEZIER + AUTO_CLAMPED, with a Cycles modifier so the loop seam
#      is smooth (frame 300 == frame 0)
#
#  TIMING (60 fps):   300 frames = 5.0 s, springy and restless
#    feet   : both heels spring up on every beat (30 f) - she bounces on her toes, feet stay planted
#    hips   : off-beat side-to-side weight pops (60 f) with a quick-then-linger shape
#    head   : cheeky tilts, nods on the bounce, quick glances left/right
#    left arm  : hand-on-hip anchor with a bouncing elbow
#    right arm : loose swing 0-52 | wind-back 52-92 | sweep up 92-132 | "ta-da" + jazz hands 128-214
#                | loops back down through the front 210-262 | settle
#    chest  : shoulder shimmy during the ta-da (132-214)
#
#  This is a FULL-BODY loop (idle display) - export it as a Looped animation and do
#  NOT apply the upper-body-only bone filter.
# =============================================================================
